---
// Pain — empathetic, editorial. Light sand canvas.
// A grid of honest friction points that front-desk-heavy hospitality teams recognise.
---

<section id="pain" class="section">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="pain__header stack" data-animate>
      <p class="eyebrow">The front-desk reality</p>
      <h2 class="pain__heading">
        Your WhatsApp never&nbsp;clocks&nbsp;off.<br />
        <span class="pain__heading--muted">You have to.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Running a hospitality or activity business on WhatsApp works — until it
        doesn't. The same friction shows up everywhere, every season.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="pain__grid" role="list" data-animate>

      <li class="pain__card">
        <span class="pain__icon" aria-hidden="true">🔁</span>
        <h3 class="pain__card-title">The same questions, forever</h3>
        <p>
          "What time does the lesson start?" "Do you have boards for kids?"
          "Is the 10 o'clock still available?" Every day, the same ten
          messages — typed out fresh each time.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="pain__card">
        <span class="pain__icon" aria-hidden="true">📵</span>
        <h3 class="pain__card-title">Messages land at the worst moments</h3>
        <p>
          In the water during a lesson. At check-in with a queue at the door.
          After dinner on a Sunday. Guests don't wait; leads go cold in under
          an hour.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="pain__card">
        <span class="pain__icon" aria-hidden="true">🗂️</span>
        <h3 class="pain__card-title">Availability lives in your head</h3>
        <p>
          Prices in one spreadsheet, session slots in a calendar, rules in
          a notes app. Every team member has a slightly different version of
          the truth. Guests sense it.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="pain__card">
        <span class="pain__icon" aria-hidden="true">🤷</span>
        <h3 class="pain__card-title">Inconsistent answers erode trust</h3>
        <p>
          One staff member quotes Monday's price. Another quotes last
          season's. The guest screenshots both and asks which one is real.
          That conversation takes twenty minutes to unpick.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="pain__card">
        <span class="pain__icon" aria-hidden="true">🪤</span>
        <h3 class="pain__card-title">The owner becomes the bottleneck</h3>
        <p>
          Complex questions always float up. Staff forward the tricky ones
          "just to be safe." You're answering WhatsApp on your days off
          because nobody else knows the full picture.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="pain__card">
        <span class="pain__icon" aria-hidden="true">🤖</span>
        <h3 class="pain__card-title">Generic chatbots make things worse</h3>
        <p>
          Off-the-shelf bots confidently invent answers, quote wrong prices,
          and promise availability you don't have. Guests lose trust. Staff
          spend time fixing what the bot got wrong.
        </p>
      </li>

    </ul>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pain__header { max-width: 680px; }

  .pain__heading { font-size: var(--step-4); margin-top: var(--space-xs); }
  .pain__heading--muted {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* 2-col on tablet, 3-col on desktop, 1-col on mobile */
  .pain__grid {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-m);
  }
  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    .pain__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .pain__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }

  .pain__card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    padding: var(--space-l);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-s);
    /* subtle left accent bar */
    border-left: 3px solid var(--sand-300);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    transition: box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease-out), border-left-color var(--dur) var(--ease-out), transform var(--dur) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .pain__card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-m);
    border-left-color: var(--terracotta-500);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .pain__icon { font-size: 1.5rem; display: block; line-height: 1; }

  .pain__card-title {
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--ink-900);
  }

  .pain__card p {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
</style>
